        <mxCell id="p5_c62" value="" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p5_c60" target="p5_c61"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_c63" value="13. 200  ENROLLED" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="3316" width="1128" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_c64" value="KONTROLLER: K1 seal-mobile TLS'i sonlandırır; gateway görmez. K2 IdP token ve DPoP birlikte doğrulanır; oturum introspection ile aktif. K3 PM yalnız PIN doğrulayıcı tutar.&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: PIN taşıma hash'i (sha256) vendor'ın KPu/JWE akışı değil. Cihaz kaydı (enrollment) ve attestation yok; sertifika lab CA'sı." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3406" width="1270" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_c65" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. 1. TLS SNI seal.lab.local  istemci sertifikası | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. TLS SNI seal.lab.local  istemci sertifikası (cihaz CA)&lt;br&gt;2. 2. L4 passthrough | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-seal]: 2. L4 passthrough (TLS açılmaz)&lt;br&gt;3. 3. TLS passthrough → seal-mobile | [kgateway gw-seal] -&gt; [seal-mobile]: 3. TLS passthrough → seal-mobile&lt;br&gt;4. 4. cihaz CN | [seal-mobile] kendi içinde: 4. cihaz CN: CERT_REQUIRED (device CA)&lt;br&gt;5. POST /seal/mobile/v1/device/enroll | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [seal-mobile]: 5. POST /seal/mobile/v1/device/enroll  {pin}  Authorization: Bearer &lt;IdP token&gt;  DPoP&lt;br&gt;6. 6. token | [seal-mobile] kendi içinde: 6. token: JWKS (HTTPS) imza, iss, aud=channel-mobile, channel=mobile, cnf&lt;br&gt;7. 7. DPoP | [seal-mobile] kendi içinde: 7. DPoP: imza(jwk), htm, htu, iat, ath, jkt=cnf.jkt, jti (replay)&lt;br&gt;8. POST /realms/.../token/introspect | [seal-mobile] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 8. POST /realms/.../token/introspect  (gw-internal → IdP, HTTPS; istemci seal-mobile)&lt;br&gt;9. 9. active=true, sub=alice | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [seal-mobile]: 9. active=true, sub=alice&lt;br&gt;10. POST /seal-pm/v1/pin/set | [seal-mobile] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 10. POST /seal-pm/v1/pin/set  (DMZ istemci mTLS, X-Seal-Key)&lt;br&gt;11. 11. /seal-pm/ BackendTLSPolicy | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [password-manager]: 11. /seal-pm/ BackendTLSPolicy (HTTPS)&lt;br&gt;12. 12. scrypt | [password-manager] kendi içinde: 12. scrypt(PIN taşıma hash) → (alice, cihaz CN) doğrulayıcı&lt;br&gt;13. 13. 200  ENROLLED | [password-manager] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 13. 200  ENROLLED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3498" width="1270" height="234" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_c66" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3746" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c2" value="3. Login (IdP: PKCE + DPoP) · V2 M1) Mobil giriş: PKCE, parola IdP'de, DPoP bağlı token, tek aktif giriş" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3854" width="1100" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
