        <mxCell id="p6_c51" value="10. DpopRequiredFilter: proof zorunlu; cnf.jkt = proof anahtarı" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="881" y="4462" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c52" value="11. TEK AKTİF GİRİŞ: alice'in diğer authorization_code oturumları silinir" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="881" y="4520" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c53" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="874" y="4603" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c54" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="114" y="4603" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c55" value="" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p6_c53" target="p6_c54"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c56" value="12. access_token (channel=mobile, aud=channel-mobile, cnf.jkt) + refresh" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="4560" width="748" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c57" value="KONTROLLER: K1 parola yalnız IdP'de; Seal ve mobil uygulama parola görmez. K2 DPoP: token anahtara bağlı (cnf.jkt). K3 yeni giriş eski kanal oturumunu düşürür.&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: PKCE ve DPoP lab'da; attestation (App Attest / Play Integrity) yok. Mobil redirect (com.bank.app) prod'da uygulama bağlantısı doğrulamalı." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="4674" width="890" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c58" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. GET /realms/bank/.../auth | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /realms/bank/.../auth  client_id=mobile-app  code_challenge (S256)&lt;br&gt;2. 2. TLS re-encrypt | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 2. TLS re-encrypt (mTLS iç CA)&lt;br&gt;3. 3. route /realms/ | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 3. route /realms/ (mobile-login)  mTLS&lt;br&gt;4. 4. authorization endpoint | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 4. authorization endpoint&lt;br&gt;5. 5. 302 /login | [Spring IdP] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 5. 302 /login (oturum çerezi)&lt;br&gt;6. POST /login | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 6. POST /login  username=alice  parola (YALNIZ IdP'de)  _csrf&lt;br&gt;7. 7. parola BCrypt doğrula | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 7. parola BCrypt doğrula (JdbcUserDetailsManager)&lt;br&gt;8. 8. 302 → code | [Spring IdP] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 8. 302 → code  (com.bank.app:/callback?code=...)&lt;br&gt;9. POST /token | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 9. POST /token  code + code_verifier  DPoP: &lt;proof, jwk&gt;&lt;br&gt;10. 10. DpopRequiredFilter | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 10. DpopRequiredFilter: proof zorunlu; cnf.jkt = proof anahtarı&lt;br&gt;11. 11. TEK AKTİF GİRİŞ | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 11. TEK AKTİF GİRİŞ: alice'in diğer authorization_code oturumları silinir&lt;br&gt;12. 12. access_token | [Spring IdP] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 12. access_token (channel=mobile, aud=channel-mobile, cnf.jkt) + refresh" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="4766" width="1000" height="218" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c59" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="4998" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7_c2" value="3. Login (PIN + cihaz imzası) · V2 M3) Mobil giriş: PIN (PM), challenge, cihaz imzası (seal-mobile), IdP'de akış durumu ve oturum zamanı" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="5106" width="1100" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
