        <mxCell id="p8_c94" value="" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p8_c92" target="p8_c93"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c95" value="21. 200" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="8192" width="178" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c96" value="KONTROLLER: K1 dış token yalnız DMZ'de; iç token yalnız DMZ→iç bağlantıda. K2 oturum iptali exchange'de (adım 8). K3 kısıtlı token ext-authz'da engellenir (adım 5).&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: iç BFF ↔ core düz HTTP (mevcut açık). İşlem onayı (transfer imzası) Seal Mobile/Intranet akışına bağlı değil; stub." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="8282" width="1460" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c97" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. GET /bff/mobile/accounts | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /bff/mobile/accounts  Bearer &lt;IdP token&gt;  DPoP: &lt;proof&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. 2. TLS re-encrypt | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 2. TLS re-encrypt&lt;br&gt;3. 3. ext-authz | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 3. ext-authz: X-Dmz-Channel=mobile, Authorization, DPoP, Host&lt;br&gt;4. 4. RS256, channel=mobile, cnf zorunlu; DPoP proo | [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 4. RS256, channel=mobile, cnf zorunlu; DPoP proof doğrula&lt;br&gt;5. 5. KISIT | [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 5. KISIT: restricted=true veya scope=activation → 403 (iş API'sine girmez)&lt;br&gt;6. 6. token exchange | [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 6. token exchange (mTLS CN=dmz-exchange-mobile), subject = dış token&lt;br&gt;7. 7. /token grant=token-exchange  audience=kgatewa | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 7. /token grant=token-exchange  audience=kgateway-internal&lt;br&gt;8. 8. subject imzası + OTURUM AKTİF mi | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 8. subject imzası + OTURUM AKTİF mi (kayıt yoksa invalid_grant)&lt;br&gt;9. 9. iç JWT | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 9. iç JWT: aud=kgateway-internal, channel=mobile, azp=dmz-exchange-mobile&lt;br&gt;10. 10. iç JWT | [Spring IdP] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 10. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;11. 11. iç JWT | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 11. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;12. 12. 200 + Authorization | [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 12. 200 + Authorization: Bearer &lt;iç JWT&gt;  (dış token iç ağa gitmez)&lt;br&gt;13. GET /bff/mobile/accounts | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 13. GET /bff/mobile/accounts + iç JWT (mTLS DMZ)&lt;br&gt;14. 14. iç JWT, RBAC | [kgateway gw-internal] kendi içinde: 14. iç JWT, RBAC: x-channel ∈ {web, mobile}&lt;br&gt;15. 15. forwardToken | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [app-bff]: 15. forwardToken: iç JWT&lt;br&gt;16. 16. hesap sorgusu | [app-bff] -&gt; [core app-core]: 16. hesap sorgusu (iç JWT)&lt;br&gt;17. 17. hesaplar | [core app-core] -&gt; [app-bff]: 17. hesaplar&lt;br&gt;18. 18. 200  channel=mobile | [app-bff] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 18. 200  channel=mobile  (token yok)&lt;br&gt;19. 19. 200 | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 19. 200&lt;br&gt;20. 20. 200 | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 20. 200&lt;br&gt;21. 21. 200 | [HAProxy] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 21. 200" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="8374" width="1460" height="362" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c98" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="8750" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p9_c2" value="5. Ek: tek aktif giriş · V2 O) Tek aktif giriş: mobil giriş yapılınca web oturumu düşer; eski token'lar reddedilir" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="8858" width="1100" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p9_c3" value="Web uygulama&lt;br&gt;(tarayıcı)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.3;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="8892" width="170" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
