        <mxCell id="p11_c94" value="20. 200" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="2418" width="178" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c95" value="KONTROLLER: K1 dış token yalnız DMZ'de; iç token istemciye dönmez. K2 oturum iptali exchange'de. K3 iç gateway RBAC (x-channel). K4 kısıtlı token ext-authz'da engellenir.&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: aynı şablon mobil ile; kanal profilleri (ChannelClaims) prod'da tek politika motorunda." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2508" width="1460" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c96" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. GET /bff/web/accounts | [Tarayıcı] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /bff/web/accounts  Authorization: Bearer &lt;web token&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. 2. TLS re-encrypt | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 2. TLS re-encrypt (NodePort 30446)&lt;br&gt;3. 3. ext-authz | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 3. ext-authz: X-Dmz-Channel=web, Authorization&lt;br&gt;4. 4. RS256 | [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 4. RS256 (JWKS), iss, aud=channel-web, channel=web, exp&lt;br&gt;5. 5. KISIT | [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 5. KISIT: restricted / scope=activation → 403&lt;br&gt;6. 6. token exchange | [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 6. token exchange (mTLS CN=dmz-exchange-web), subject = web token&lt;br&gt;7. 7. /token grant=token-exchange  audience=kgatewa | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 7. /token grant=token-exchange  audience=kgateway-internal&lt;br&gt;8. 8. subject imzası + OTURUM AKTİF mi | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 8. subject imzası + OTURUM AKTİF mi (kayıt yoksa invalid_grant)&lt;br&gt;9. 9. iç JWT | [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 9. iç JWT: aud=kgateway-internal, channel=web&lt;br&gt;10. 10. iç JWT | [Spring IdP] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 10. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;11. 11. iç JWT | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 11. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;12. 12. 200 + Authorization | [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 12. 200 + Authorization: Bearer &lt;iç JWT&gt;&lt;br&gt;13. GET /bff/web/accounts | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 13. GET /bff/web/accounts + iç JWT (mTLS DMZ)&lt;br&gt;14. 14. RBAC x-channel=web; forwardToken | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [BFF app-bff]: 14. RBAC x-channel=web; forwardToken&lt;br&gt;15. 15. hesap sorgusu | [BFF app-bff] -&gt; [core app-core]: 15. hesap sorgusu (iç JWT)&lt;br&gt;16. 16. hesaplar | [core app-core] -&gt; [BFF app-bff]: 16. hesaplar&lt;br&gt;17. 17. 200  channel=web | [BFF app-bff] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 17. 200  channel=web  (token yok)&lt;br&gt;18. 18. 200 | [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 18. 200&lt;br&gt;19. 19. 200 | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 19. 200&lt;br&gt;20. 20. 200 | [HAProxy] -&gt; [Tarayıcı]: 20. 200" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2600" width="1460" height="346" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c97" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2960" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
